---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import CTABand from '../components/CTABand.astro';
---
<Base
  title="AI Consultancy | 33Mega"
  description="AI consultancy from 33Mega: AI strategy, agentic automation, digital transformation, technology review and fractional CTO support — senior judgement, no heavyweight consulting model."
>
  <section class="band halftone">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Services</p>
      <h1>AI Consultancy</h1>
      <p class="lead" style="max-width: 820px;">
        The same senior team that designs and runs The Atom helps organisations put AI and
        technology to work — with the judgement that comes from building real systems, not
        selling slideware.
      </p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button primary" href="/contact/">Request a conversation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band white">
    <div class="section-inner grid-2">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Our view</p>
        <h2>Technology should quietly help humans do better work.</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          AI and AI agents are remarkable tools — but only if you cut through the noise and point
          them at the parts of the business that matter.
        </p>
        <p>
          The last thing a business needs is AI slop and more screen time. What it needs is
          trusted, often invisible technology that takes on administration, repetitive work and
          digital friction, so people can focus on what makes the business tick. That is the
          test we apply to every recommendation we make.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="pop-panel violet">
        <h3>How we engage</h3>
        <ul class="check-list">
          <li>Understand the business first — not the technology catalogue.</li>
          <li>Identify where step-by-step improvement or radical change is possible.</li>
          <li>Guide implementation with governance and commercial discipline.</li>
          <li>Senior people throughout — no bait-and-switch to a junior bench.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="center">
        <p class="eyebrow">What's inside</p>
        <h2>One banner, five disciplines.</h2>
        <p class="lead" style="max-width: 760px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
          Every engagement is assembled around the problem, drawing on five things we do well.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top: 38px;">
        <div class="pop-panel cyan">
          <h3>AI strategy</h3>
          <p>Where AI genuinely helps your organisation — and where it doesn't. A practical roadmap for boards and leadership teams, grounded in what the technology can actually do today.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pop-panel pink">
          <h3>Agentic automation</h3>
          <p>AI agents that take on real work: administration, document handling, workflow glue. Designed, governed and measured — so automation removes legwork instead of adding noise.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pop-panel gold">
          <h3>Digital transformation</h3>
          <p>Moving from how things are to how they should work: process, platform and data changes sequenced so the business keeps running while it improves.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pop-panel violet">
          <h3>Technology review</h3>
          <p>An experienced, independent look at your architecture, scalability, security posture and costs — with findings you can act on, not a hundred-page shelf document.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pop-panel cream">
          <h3>Fractional CTO</h3>
          <p>Senior product and technology leadership for founders, boards and leadership teams — the judgement of a CTO without the full-time hire, from people who have held the role.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pop-panel">
          <h3>Why us</h3>
          <p>We have founded, led and exited technology companies, held CTO and SVP product roles, and built platforms used across the media industry. We advise on what we have done.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTABand
    title="Start with a conversation, not a contract."
    text="Tell us what's slowing the business down. If we can help, we'll say how. If we can't, we'll say that too."
    buttonLabel="Talk to us"
  />
</Base>
